--
-- Description:
-- Form Definition for Frameworks Frame Type 11
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Methods defined:
--
--  Method call                      Return              Description
--  ===========                      ======              ===========
--  edgentry()                       -
--  resetdims()                      -
